# Atmosphere hosts for the nextendo-testing stack on a LAN. run_all.ps1 -Action hosts fills in the addresses
# and writes stack/out/hosts.txt: copy it to sd:/atmosphere/hosts/emummc.txt (or sysmmc.txt) and reboot.
# ============================================================
#  NEXTENDO NETWORK - Atmosphere DNS-MITM (LOCAL stack)
#  Generated for the PC Wi-Fi LAN at ${HOST} (was hotspot 192.168.137.1).
#  Atmosphere rule: the LAST matching line wins.
#    '*' = 0+ chars   '%' = lp1
#  Copy to BOTH:
#    /atmosphere/hosts/sysmmc.txt
#    /atmosphere/hosts/emummc.txt
#  and set in /atmosphere/config/system_settings.ini:
#    [atmosphere]
#    enable_dns_mitm = u8!0x1
# ============================================================

